          "_name": "menu1",
          "_sourceTheme": "levelm4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"menu\" group=\"Menu\" plugins=\"DropDown, TouchSwipe\" always-top global once=\"menu\" not-draggable position-absolute>\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Logo Size\" inline name=\"logoSize\" min=\"3.8\" max=\"8\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"8\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Brand Name\" name=\"showBrand\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Menu Items\" name=\"showItems\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Icons\" name=\"showIcons\">\n        <select title=\"Icons\" name=\"iconsAmount\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icons Color\" name=\"iconsColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Button(s)\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Sticky\" name=\"sticky\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Collapsed\" name=\"collapsed\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparent\">\n\n\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Drop Down BG\" name=\"ddbg\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hamburger Color\" name=\"hamburgerColor\" value=\"#000000\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"menuBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n\n    <nav class=\"navbar navbar-dropdown\" mbr-class=\"{'navbar-fixed-top':sticky,\n                     'navbar-expand-lg':!collapsed,\n                     'collapsed':collapsed}\">\n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"navbar-brand\">\n                <span mbr-if=\"showLogo\" class=\"navbar-logo\">\n                    <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/untitled-design-11.png-509x255.png\" alt=\"Mobirise\" mbr-style=\"{'height': logoSize + 'rem'}\">\n                    </a>\n                </span>\n                <span mbr-if=\"showBrand\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" class=\"navbar-caption-wrap\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnRemove\"><a class=\"navbar-caption text-black\" data-app-selector=\".navbar-caption\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"></a></span>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" aria-controls=\"navbarNavAltMarkup\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" mbr-if=\"showItems\">\n                <div class=\"hamburger\">\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                </div>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbarSupportedContent\">\n                <ul mbr-menu class=\"navbar-nav nav-dropdown\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-class=\"{'nav-right': !showButtons,'navbar-nav-top-padding': isPublish && !showBrand && !showLogo}\"><li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link text-black text-primary\" href=\"index.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            Home</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle text-black\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\">About Us</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black\" href=\"page1.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\" target=\"_blank\">Overview</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Team</a></div>\n                    </li>\n\n\n\n                    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle text-black\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Laboratories</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page4.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Digital Manufacturing Robotics<br>and Automation Lab</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page9.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Electric and Autonomous Vehicle Lab</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page8.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Factory Automation Lab</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page11.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Industrial Internet of Things Lab</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page10.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Microgrid Lab</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page5.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product Design Lab</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page6.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Simulation and Test Lab - Hardware</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"page7.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Simulation and Test Lab - Software</a><a class=\"text-black dropdown-item\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Supporting Facilities</a></div></li><li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle text-black\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            Partners</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">SIEMENS (Coming Soon)</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Wipro (Coming Soon)</a></div></li><li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle text-black\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Programs</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Training and Certification (Coming Soon)</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Workshops and Seminars&nbsp;(Coming Soon)</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black\" href=\"#\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Internship and Students Engagement&nbsp;(Coming Soon)</a></div></li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-black text-primary\" href=\"page12.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Research</a>\n                    </li><li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-black text-primary\" href=\"page13.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Gallery</a></li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-black text-primary\" href=\"page14.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact Us</a></li></ul>\n                <div class=\"icons-menu\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-user mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 1\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-skype socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 2\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-vimeo socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 3\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont mbri-info\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 4\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont mbri-info\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 5\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont mbri-info\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"navbar-buttons mbr-section-btn\"><a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Sign up</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "uK2EpAtMEF",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "menu",
          "_params": {},
          "_anchor": "menu1-5d"
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".mail": {
              "position": "relative",
              "cursor": "pointer",
              "letter-spacing": "1px",
              "width": "fit-content",
              "display": "inline-block",
              "&:after": {
                "content": "\"\"",
                "position": "absolute",
                "height": "1px",
                "width": "100%",
                "background": "currentColor",
                "bottom": "-6px",
                "opacity": "0.1",
                "left": "0"
              },
              "&:before": {
                "content": "\"\"",
                "position": "absolute",
                "height": "1px",
                "width": "0",
                "transition": "all 0.4s ease-in-out",
                "background": "currentColor",
                "bottom": "-6px",
                "left": "auto",
                "right": "0"
              },
              "&:hover": {
                "&:before": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "right": "auto",
                  "left": "0"
                }
              },
              "color": "#5758e0",
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#999999"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text, .col": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content02",
          "_sourceTheme": "levelm4",
          "_customHTML": "<section group=\"Content\" class=\"content2 levelm4_content02\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"15\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Sub Title\" name=\"showsubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Link\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dsc00489.jpg-2000x1125.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#7f1933\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#333333\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        \n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n\n            <div class=\"mbr-black col-md-12 col-lg-4 align-left\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold mbr-black pb-4 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Supporting Facility</h3>\n\n            </div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"mbr-black col-md-12 col col-lg-8 align-left\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\">ABOUT US\n                </h4>\n\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-black mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .col\">The IIoT Lab at IIT Tirupati's Centre of Excellence focuses on real-time industrial data monitoring, predictive maintenance, and smart manufacturing. It provides students and professionals with a platform to integrate cloud computing, edge analytics, and IoT-based automation.<br></p>\n\n                <p class=\"mail mbr-black mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-app-selector=\".mail\">EXPLORE ALL FEATURES</p>\n\n            </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uK2EpB4vAb",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {},
          "_anchor": "content02-5e"
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "position": "relative",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".card-header": {
              "background": "transparent"
            },
            "img": {
              "width": "90%",
              "box-shadow": "0px 30px 70px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)",
              "margin": "auto"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
              ".wrapper": {
                "padding": "0"
              },
              "img": {
                "width": "100%",
                "padding": "0rem",
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-iconfont": {
              "font-size": "1rem !important",
              "font-family": "\"Moririse2\" !important",
              "&:before": {
                "content": "\"\\e960\""
              }
            },
            ".card": {
              "border-radius": "0px",
              "margin-bottom": "-1px",
              ".card-header": {
                "border-radius": "0px",
                "border": "0px",
                "padding": "0",
                "a.panel-title": {
                  "margin-bottom": "0",
                  "font-style": "normal",
                  "font-weight": "500",
                  "display": "block",
                  "text-decoration": "none !important",
                  "margin-top": "-1px",
                  "line-height": "normal",
                  "&:focus": {
                    "text-decoration": "none !important"
                  },
                  "h5": {
                    ".sign": {
                      "padding-right": "1rem"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              ".panel-body": {
                "color": "#767676",
                "padding-top": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "h5": {
              "flex-direction": "row-reverse",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-top": "0rem",
              "border-bottom": "1px solid @borderColor",
              "padding": "1rem 0rem"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".wrapper": {
                "padding": "2rem 1rem"
              },
              "h5": {
                "padding": "1rem 0rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".panel-text": {
              "color": "#555555"
            },
            "H4": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            "H5": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "H3": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "accordion01",
          "_sourceTheme": "levelm4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"accordion1 levelm4_accordion01\" group=\"Accordions\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" name=\"borderColor\" value=\"#e5e5e5\" selected>\n        <select title=\"Accordions Count\" name=\"bootstrapAccordion\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#999999\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        \n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n\n            <div class=\"mbr-black m-auto col-md-12 md-pb col-lg-6\">\n                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/istock-1435901681.jpg-1626x810.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 m-auto col-lg-6\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title align-left mbr-bold mbr-white pb-4 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Industrial Internet of Things Lab</h3>\n                <div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n                    <div class=\"card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                <h5 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>Key Focus Areas</h5>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">1. 5G Integration\n<br>2. Augmented Reality (AR)\n<br>3. Virtual Reality (VR), and\n<br>4. Supply Chain Optimization,\n<br>5. Industrial IoT &amp; Sensor Integration\n<br>6. Predictive Maintenance &amp; Smart Monitoring\n<br>7. Edge &amp; Cloud Computing for Industry 4.0\n<br>8. Data Analytics &amp; Cybersecurity for IIoT\n<br>9. Energy Efficiency &amp; Sustainability\n<br>10. Machine Learning for Predictive Maintenance &amp; Anomaly Detection&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                <h5 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>Software / Hardware</h5>\n                            </a>\n\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">1. MindSphere: A cloud-based IoT operating system for industrial data collection and analytics.\n<br>2. Mendix-Pro: A low-code application development tool for IIoT system integration.\n<br>3. IoT Sensors &amp; Controllers: Supports real-time data acquisition, analysis, and remote automation.\n<br>4. MindSpher Mind Access Developer\n<br>5. Visual Flow Creator\n<br>6. Data Exploration on Tableau&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                <h5 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>Training Programs</h5>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">1. For Engineering Students: Hands-on training in IoT-based automation, cloud integration, and data analytics.\n<br>2. For Industry Professionals: Courses on industrial cybersecurity, predictive analytics, and edge computing.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFour\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                <h5 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>Potential Beneficiaries</h5>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFour\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">1. Researchers working on smart factories, real-time monitoring, and machine learning for IIoT.\n<br>2. Industries requiring data-driven maintenance, energy efficiency, and IoT integration.\n<br>3. Startups focused on AI-based automation and smart industrial solutions.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFive\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                <h5 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>Research and Consultancy</h5>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFive\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">1. Automation Technologies – Integrating factory automation solutions.\n<br>2. Predictive Maintenance – Using sensors &amp; AI-based fault detection​.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingSix\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                <h5 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>Market Analysis\n                                </h5>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingSix\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut\n                                    magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
